# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/
# Untracked deliberately: a lockfile generated on Windows was repeatedly out
# of sync with what `npm ci` demands on EAS Build's Linux image (missing
# transitive entries even after a from-scratch regeneration). Letting every
# environment run a plain `npm install` sidesteps that recurring mismatch.
package-lock.json

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

